{
  "_source": "Arabic for Shopify's checkout, the part auto-translate left behind. Same resource and same mechanism as system-strings-ar.json (ONLINE_STORE_THEME_LOCALE_CONTENT, keyed by Shopify's key); kept in its own file because it is a different job -- that one is the storefront, this one is checkout.",
